// Axiom Compiler — MIR Verifier (compiler/verify/verifier.ax)
// Port of bootstrap/axiom0/src/verify/verify.h and verify.c, plus standalone MIR text verification.
//
// Enforces MIR structural, control-flow, type, ownership, initialization, capability, and
// drop-flag invariants before and after drop elaboration:
//   - verify_mir / ax_verify_mir: CFG terminator validity, target bounds, local and projection
//     bounds/types, rvalue/statement/cast/aggregate type consistency, call signature compatibility,
//     return place type compatibility, and definite initialization on standalone MIR.
//   - verify_mir_own / ax_verify_mir_own: forward ownership dataflow (Bottom/Uninit/Owned/Moved),
//     use-before-init, use-after-move, overwrite-without-drop, missing-drop at return, and
//     double-drop / drop-after-move checks.
//   - verify_mir_cap: capability and borrow validity on MIR places and references.
//   - verify_mir_drop_flags: post-drop-elaboration drop-flag consistency and elaboration completeness.
//   - verify_parse_mir / verify_mir_text: non-aborting MIR text parser and verifier matching
//     `axiom0 check <file.mir>` (emitting AX_VERIFY_MIR_SYNTAX on malformed MIR text).
